|   PWG - TBD 
|   FSG - Open Printing International Steering Committee
| 
| Tuesday - 16 November 2004
|   PWG - WIMS (Web-based Imaging Management Service)
|   FSG - Open Printing WG meetings (JT, Driver, etc.)
